    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i get the legal part but it just feels like they're basically just hoarding all this cash in a vault for a while. it feels less like a professional service and more like some kind of gatekeeper situation. do they ever have issues with people trying to snatch the money or anything like that?",
